parameters.RequestForInformationInput/message:
Dear store manager,

The following item has been nominated for a promotion or clearance application based on weekly findings.

SKU: @{items('Loop_over_each_gaming_SKU')?['SKUName']} 

Weekly Findings: 
@{body('agent-7d5d1903-f892-41df-a546-95aef444dbd9')?['structuredOutput/Findings']} 

If promotion is chosen, store employees will receive the following guidance:

Promo: 
@{body('agent-7d5d1903-f892-41df-a546-95aef444dbd9')?['structuredOutput/Promo']} 

If clearance is chosen, store employees will receive the following guidance:

Clearance:
@{body('agent-7d5d1903-f892-41df-a546-95aef444dbd9')?['structuredOutput/Clearance']} 

Please select your preferred option, as well as (if desired), maximum and minimum discount to be applied.

Thank you

assignments.value:
@{concat(
  if(equals(body('connector-9dc5e271-f730-4189-8ec6-5dfd1d013fd9')?['text'], 'Accept Promo'), body('agent-7d5d1903-f892-41df-a546-95aef444dbd9')?['structuredOutput/Promo'], body('agent-7d5d1903-f892-41df-a546-95aef444dbd9')?['structuredOutput/Clearance']),
  if(not(empty(body('connector-9dc5e271-f730-4189-8ec6-5dfd1d013fd9')?['number_1'])), concat(' Min Discount: ', string(body('connector-9dc5e271-f730-4189-8ec6-5dfd1d013fd9')?['number_1'])), ''),
  if(not(empty(body('connector-9dc5e271-f730-4189-8ec6-5dfd1d013fd9')?['number_2'])), concat(' Max Discount: ', string(body('connector-9dc5e271-f730-4189-8ec6-5dfd1d013fd9')?['number_2'])), '')
)}

